## Hypothesis

If inbound mail is scanned every 4 hours on both Resend receiving (`mail.murakumo.cloud`)
and the Cursor-session Gmail path (`Reply-To hello@gftd.co.jp`), then a Mouse or
Sycom reply is handled within one interval of arrival, without sending a second
unsolicited RFQ.

