## Hard gates

- Do not PO or send funds.
- Do not claim Node 24 or MK-1 is on sale.
- Do not treat SCANNED=0 / missing Resend key as zero replies.
- Do not bypass CAPTCHA.
- Do not dual-send a correction RFQ unless owner asks.
- Secrets: known identifiers only (`gftd.resend` / `API_KEY`, `~/.gftd/resend-api-key`). No dump-all.

**Gate:** yellow — supplier correspondence allowed. Consumer sale remains red.

## One selected action

Arm one 4-hour inbox loop (launchd `com.gftd.murakumo-oem-rfq` + Cursor session loop)
that wakes a model only when a fresh Mouse/Sycom message is unmatched. WIP=1.

